;----------------------------
;When you start up a dream
;----------------------------
@LUCID_DREAM_START_28
CALLF PooMe(MASTER)
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"While walking in a labyrinth, your bowels suddenly churn in agony, forcing you to hunch over in pain")
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"The cramps are intense, very intense. As you take each step, the cramps get exponentially harder and harder to endure.")
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"It gets to the to the point where you're at your wits' end, forcing you to give up.")
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"You squat down in shame, put your hands on your knees, and push.")
CALL PoopyDescribe(MASTER)
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"You shake your head as your accident ends.")
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"You feel better. Way better, but then you hear your tummy rumble again.")
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"You need to find a diaper change. Your bowels are still not happy, and you've already packed your diaper to the brim.")
;<DREAM START>
;Find clean diapers that you can poop inside to help ease the tummyache.
;Having a diaper blowout or defecating in the open is an automatic loss.

;----------------------------
;Ending of the dream
;Can be good or bad
;----------------------------
@LUCID_DREAM_END_28
;diaper blowout
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"Your vision suddenly shifts as you wake up.")
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"Panicking, you squish the back of your diaper area to see if you had an accident.")
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"You did. You definitely pooped yourself")

